{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"unstable-arthritic-adouri","creation_channel":"cli","description":"Implement the NEW code-review attestation once its ADR (refutable-meaningful-borzoi) is accepted. review-code RECORDS/SIGNS a reusable code-review op-cert bound to the ADR-defined diff/ref material fingerprint and ticket binding; the merge gate CONSUMES it per the ADR's trust-boundary ruling (whether/where a reused attestation may satisfy LLM-Review +1). Reuses the shared seam from citreous-arboreous-coral. BLOCKED until the ADR lands — the op-cert kind, material fingerprint, ticket binding, and merge-vote policy are all ADR outputs. Independently verifiable: sign a review, reuse it on an unchanged ref (accept), mutate the ref (reject).","id":"86c0-2e93-93c7-4704","parent_id":"3d86-9fc2-6095-4c69","priority":3,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"story","title":"Code-review op-cert: producer (review-code signs) + consumer (merge-gate reuse)"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787594282197325001,"uuid":"2652ca13-a3b4-4360-a2fe-ca96d29f7ac3"}